msgstr "边数"

#: properties.py:223
msgid "Simplify each merged leaf mesh. Off by default to keep generation fast"
msgstr "简化每个合并后的树叶网格。默认关闭以保持生成速度"

#: properties.py:217
msgid "Simplify the trunk mesh (includes roots if joined into it). Off by default to keep generation fast"
msgstr "简化树干网格（若根系已合并则包含根系）。默认关闭以保持生成速度"

#: properties.py:352
msgid "Spike Horizontal Deform"
msgstr "尖刺水平变形"

#: properties.py:344
msgid "Spike Tilt"
msgstr "尖刺倾斜"

#: properties.py:116
#: properties.py:188
msgid "Split Chance"
msgstr "分叉概率"

#: properties.py:121
msgid "Split Position Max"
msgstr "分叉位置最大值"

#: properties.py:117
msgid "Split Position Min"
msgstr "分叉位置最小值"

#: properties.py:269
msgid "Spread"
msgstr "扩散"

#: properties.py:171
msgid "Strength of random left/right (horizontal) bending as each root grows, independent of the up-then-down curve driven by Curvature. 0 keeps growth confined to a single vertical plane; higher values wander further side to side"
msgstr "每条根系生长时随机左右（水平）弯曲的强度，不受弯曲度所驱动的先上后下曲线影响。0 使生长限制在单一垂直平面内；数值越大，左右游走越远"

#: properties.py:318
msgid "Taper"
msgstr "锥化"

#: properties.py:93
#: properties.py:161
msgid "Thickness"
msgstr "粗细"

#: properties.py:97
#: properties.py:162
msgid "Thickness Random"
msgstr "粗细随机"

#: properties.py:288
msgid "Tier Count"
msgstr "层级数量"

#: properties.py:306
msgid "Tier Overlap"
msgstr "层级重叠"

#: panel.py:17
msgid "Tree"
msgstr "树"

#: panel.py:9
msgid "Tree Gen"
msgstr "树木生成"

#: panel.py:6
msgid "Tree Generator"
msgstr "树木生成器"

#: properties.py:15
msgid "Tree Height"
msgstr "树高"

#: properties.py:204
msgid "Trim away each root's overlap with the trunk via Boolean Difference before joining it in, instead of joining the raw root mesh straight into the trunk. Roots always end up joined into the trunk as a single object either way; this only removes the hidden overlap a plain join would leave behind"
msgstr "在合并前，通过布尔差集修剪每条根系与树干的重叠部分，而不是直接将原始根系网格合并进树干。无论哪种方式，根系最终都会作为单个物体合并进树干；此处仅移除直接合并会留下的隐藏重叠"

#: properties.py:133
msgid "Trim away each secondary branch's overlap with the branch it grows from via Boolean Difference before joining it in, instead of joining the raw meshes straight together. A main branch and its secondary branches always end up joined into a single object either way; this only removes the hidden overlap a plain join would leave behind"
msgstr "在合并前，通过布尔差集修剪每条次级枝条与其生长来源枝条的重叠部分，而不是直接将原始网格合并在一起。无论哪种方式，主枝与其次级枝条最终都会合并为单个物体；此处仅移除直接合并会留下的隐藏重叠"

#: properties.py:194
msgid "Trim away each secondary root's overlap with the root it grows from via Boolean Difference before joining it in, instead of joining the raw meshes straight together. Roots always end up joined into a single object either way; this only removes the hidden overlap a plain join would leave behind"
msgstr "在合并前，通过布尔差集修剪每条次级根系与其生长来源根系的重叠部分，而不是直接将原始网格合并在一起。无论哪种方式，根系最终都会合并为单个物体；此处仅移除直接合并会留下的隐藏重叠"

#: properties.py:19
msgid "Trunk Bend"
msgstr "树干弯曲"

#: properties.py:221
msgid "Trunk Decimate Ratio"
msgstr "树干精简比例"

#: properties.py:16
msgid "Trunk Radius"
msgstr "树干半径"

#: properties.py:17
msgid "Trunk Segments"
msgstr "树干分段"

#: properties.py:18
msgid "Trunk Sides"
msgstr "树干边数"

#: properties.py:181
msgid "Upward Phase"
msgstr "向上相位"

#: properties.py:310
msgid "Vertical Width"
msgstr "垂直宽度"

#: properties.py:117
msgid "Where along the branch's own length (0 = base, 1 = tip) a split can occur"
msgstr "分支自身长度上的位置（0 = 基部，1 = 末端），可在此处发生分叉"

#: properties.py:273
msgid "Width"
msgstr "宽度"

